#: scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5c8977f7c2d510ed45a68cd4c440c55948181dac5070849e1887c76329e968c
#. default-sha256: 6bb152ac6067b9b867e1ca06cfdc49521fafa423fbed8fb3d32deb095408cffa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t work on some nobleman’s estate,⟪k:1⟫but instead, I did physical labor—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"construction work.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I built roads and buildings, tore down hills and mountains."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non lavoravo nella tenuta di qualche nobiluomo,⟪k:1⟫piuttosto facevo lavori fisici—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"lavori di costruzione.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Costruivo strade ed edifici, abbattevo colline e montagne."

#: scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f16166b3d118450effaf21bda6f7c67b115179ec9df9890962eef557b1a84022
#. default-sha256: 78db98550a31dbf01f70e96832a6db98cfe4d9537fc0c66fe89851d2f00e40c0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while I doubt I need to tell you this, living conditions were miserable. ⟪k:1⟫Other "
"slaves withered away and died on a daily basis."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non credo ci sia bisogno di dirlo, ma le condizioni di vita erano precarie. ⟪k:1⟫Ogni giorno "
"c’erano schiavi che deperivano fino a morire."

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88d8329ed30bc8499259583b355c71912f2a7a9cb1052bfe3e11b480d8ef55d3
#. default-sha256: f8d01049d3d5b71610fcadf15fcaebae575f75e530493557a1ec3ff15aef245b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Working a noble’s estate would have been easier, without a doubt,⟪k:1⟫if only for the fact I "
"would have a specific master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lavorare alla dimora di un nobile sarebbe stato più facile, senza alcun dubbio, se non altro "
"per il fatto che avrei avuto un padrone specifico."

#: scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab59039c8e213389e568de355fa7d8d3fff782c5f808fed1ac07cf83b034d83c
#. default-sha256: 11a21a280cdd96e4fad314d3b38ccb5b437ca306e3e0d320931d50f8df025fce
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t remember anything about my life before becoming a slave.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I have are "
"those few images, from which I can guess I was part of a caravan,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ricordo nulla della mia vita prima di diventare uno schiavo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non mi è rimasto "
"altro che qualche immagine indistinta."

#: scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 098a27f068e62ce0a23fa7c278766c603148f27ee5206ef811e790c9fb8f8ed5
#. default-sha256: 4269485ca50d1248da12ab9f4a07ccc70064bf6644d55356539ef97ab8f9c34e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I next woke up, I had been stripped bare and was surrounded by men I didn’t recognize. "
"⟪k:1⟫The words they spoke were gibberish to my ears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando mi risvegliai, mi ritrovai spogliato di tutto, circondato da uomini che non "
"conoscevo. ⟪k:1⟫Ciò che dicevano era incomprensibile⟪k:2⟫per le mie orecchie."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D06F54B4_185B_46AE_B6E6_F141A5CF6BAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9ea9a11f52aac864c0c4dcde8247b50df9edc6ca55f284bcdb8dd80e7eb1a6
