msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10dc9a5b0436deb9897477b3ddb6f2d94bae5e40b5954fe8026ecbeff0dc8b5f
#. default-sha256: aeef99d069e6f32eb0987fd4f35c8fbb4588cc45e50d52969a9951148dc0b62a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, I came to learn their language—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫though I can only speak it; ⟪k:4⟫I "
"don’t know how to read or write."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Col tempo, giunsi ad apprendere la loro lingua, sebbene sappia solo parlarla—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫non "
"so né scrivere né leggere."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a87ad7d96e3f825425ea9a629c4e3acb6bf3bbc8a2cf8c249ec7425c94c1f0bc
#. default-sha256: 831da8f4860cdb256d48a510bc7dc7d89e7e7b87a16467ba309dd3de771b32d9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A darkness grew inside me with each repeated insult.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wanted to make them pay for "
"the daily abuse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Man mano che sentivo ripetermi quegli insulti, dentro di me cresceva l’oscurità.⟪k:1⟫ Volevo "
"fargliela pagare per la continua umiliazione."

#: scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f27c6b78832dfb6a9999fabfb86e56cd5b07e8cb50d7cce705b735b09b08f40e
#. default-sha256: 47b7bc935976d86830441ba47adda30c1930b6efff2095bfa4829991ee9014ce
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And who wouldn’t? The desire to exact vengeance when you’ve been mistreated is only natural. "
"It’s perfectly reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E chi non lo vorrebbe? Il desiderio di vendicarsi quando si viene maltrattati è più che "
"naturale. ⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ perfettamente logico."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6729ce12f0406329905f94497f475704edb9bb523a745f075b9a789274c497e8
#. default-sha256: 1d43cdd4deae18bc1478ff0f883e68e71f57883f53734a72c51aebafb774a120
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They looked like me a year earlier: ⟪k:1⟫deprived of food and water and beaten into "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sembravano come me un anno prima: ⟪k:1⟫sprovvisti di cibo e di acqua,⟪k:2⟫e ridotti alla "
"sottomissione."

#: scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f05aa378bbabb5add0fb025c960e4f6f4e02655deaccd94eb7e00429c458563a
#. default-sha256: ee0c947697e69fcb7d64a5724183f7b0f15aea72d9aac73b70bad37ca9c08b5f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting beside me was a young girl, crying in silence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Seduta di fianco a me c’era una giovane ragazza che piangeva in silenzio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78e6283c2242618be744567c51407cecc92e1b3e95751c857d1c82b99aeff932
#. default-sha256: 0ad9f5be4baf6eaa301035ef92c7f0bb65a1ce1b2bfc7c376e3defdba6244847
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫perhaps because I had a similarly unusual appearance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What caught my attention, "
"though, was the way she was crying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫forse perché io stesso avevo un aspetto altrettanto insolito.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ciò che catturò la "
"mia attenzione, tuttavia, fu il modo in cui stava piangendo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2a03b5a5e2c42364dbde76b48e73cc161aa28108b34b0d90cf57100bd2cc8a2
#. default-sha256: cefb7271e04bcc641882c4c31200e052fe92f1b2a312ec291fe564aa6bdac0c8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, I still don’t understand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Continuo tuttora a non capirlo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b8c32ef454f84e2960fda1401bd4c70eca08052bf1301251808da74c278195d
#. default-sha256: 50a75358919a93061fa7ff226d1a20e6c39a4f6bbe03cbed1d4e5545b0c492b0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so I took action, driven by that desire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così agii, guidato da quel desiderio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB056D07_1356_41C0_84A8_F4DD8B0136A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4eaf1430171181fa387faefd42969d9ee53536226121fbf2407c62ac07c66aa
